0","score":{"scale":100,"source":"anilist","value":68},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2022,"series":["al-149073"],"seriesIds":[149073],"startDate":{"day":1,"month":8,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":true,"id":4,"name":"bones"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Original animation episodes for the fifth season of Boku no Hero Academia.\n\nEntry includes:\n\n1) Boku no Hero Academia: HLB (My Hero Academia: HLB)\n\nHLB stands for “Hero League of Baseball” - it is a baseball league founded by pro-heroes who love baseball!\n\nIt’s game day! The last game of HLB championship is between Gang Orca and Shishido's two rival agencies. They form a team (“Orcas” and “Lionels”) to compete. In the world of HLB, there is no rule – using their quirks is of course accepted. However, just when the game is about to finish, they are interrupted by a villain. Who will be the winner of HLB!?\n\n2) Boku no Hero Academia: Warae! Jigoku no You ni (My Hero Academia: Laugh! As if you are in hell)\n\nDeku, Bakugo, and Todoroki participate in internship under the No.1 hero, Endeavor's agency. One of their tasks these days is to find a villain (“Smiley”) who draws doodles in the city. However, since the urgency is so low, they let other pro-heroes solve this case. One day, Smiley draws a doodle on Endeavor’s house! Being furious, Endeavor himself and the 1-A trio go out to get the villain. However, Smiley’s quirk turns out to be something ridiculous but powerful... It is to make anyone who looks into his eyes laugh hysterically! Can the team capture the villain and stop laughing!?\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\nNote: The ONA had a preliminary showing in theaters from June 16 to June 19 as part of  \"Hero Day\" 2022."},"tags":[{"name":"Super Power","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Baseball","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Superhero","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"My Hero Academia Season 5 OVA","english":"My Hero Academia Season 5 OVA","native":"僕のヒーローアカデミア 5 (ONA)","romaji":"Boku no Hero Academia 5 (ONA)","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"僕のヒーローアカデミア 笑え！地獄のように"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"我的英雄学院 笑吧！如同地狱一般"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"My Hero Academia: Laugh! As if you are in hell"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Boku no Hero Academia: Warae! Jigoku no You ni"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}